# Data, checkpoints and experiment outputs stay out of git.
# Dataset images may not be redistributed (see docs/DATASET_CARD.md) and
# checkpoints are published separately with a pinned revision and SHA-256.
datasets/
data/raw/
runs/
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx
*.torchscript
*.engine
models/*
!models/README.md

